    "purpose": "Correct four defects found while the S62 student-policy rollout job was still generating, and register the corrected stage 2, the already-implemented weight-interpolation diagnostic as the first queued experiment, and the CURE intervention screen as a later item. The four corrections are: a per-row stopping criterion; a control-teacher corpus budget read from a verified student corpus receipt rather than zero; a per-problem ledger that makes p(1-p) computable from attempts; and a reference-anchored prefix-local preference objective in place of a reverse KL that a cached scalar teacher log-probability cannot implement.",
